 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "第四种，新增的函数，绕过了原有的检查。",
   "spoken": "第四种，新增的函数，绕过了原有的检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.174
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "2023 年 3 月，Euler Finance 损失约 1.97 亿美元，大部分后来归还。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 3 月，Euler Finance 损失约 1.97 亿美元，大部分后来归环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.236,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 6.334,
   "speechEnd": 11.726
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "根因是新加的捐赠函数，没有做健康检查。",
   "spoken": "根因是新加的捐赠函数，没有做健康检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.792,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 12.89,
   "speechEnd": 16.354
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "别的入口都检查了，偏偏新入口漏掉了。",
   "spoken": "别的入口都检查了，偏偏新入口漏掉了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.428,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 17.526,
   "speechEnd": 20.573
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "识别信号是，新增了一个能改余额或债务的入口。",
   "spoken": "识别信号是，新增了一个能改余额或债务的入口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.632,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 21.73,
   "speechEnd": 25.837
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "防御是统一的操作后检查，所有入口都要经过，再用不变量测试兜底。",
   "spoken": "防御是统一的操作后检查，所有入口都要经过，再用不变量测试兜底。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.892,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 26.99,
   "speechEnd": 32.168
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "第五种，改动过的分叉和新版本，没有重新审计。",
   "spoken": "第五种，改动过的分岔和新版本，没有重新审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.232,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 33.33,
   "speechEnd": 37.163
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "2021 年 4 月的 Uranium Finance，分叉了 Uniswap V2。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 4 月的 Uranium Finance，分岔了 Uniswap V2。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.228,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 38.326,
   "speechEnd": 43.028
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "改手续费时，漏改了一个常数，恒定乘积的检查就此失效，损失约 5000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "改手续费时，漏改了一个常数，恒定乘积的检查就此失效，损失约 5000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 44.088,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "speechStart": 44.186,
   "speechEnd": 50.578
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "识别信号只有一句话，只改了一行。",
   "spoken": "识别信号只有一句话，只改了一航。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 51.628,
   "dur": 3.72,
   "speechStart": 51.726,
   "speechEnd": 54.535
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "防御是改动即重审，对差异做审计。",
   "spoken": "防御是改动即虫审，对差异做审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 55.568,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 55.666,
   "speechEnd": 58.737
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "第六种，签名人看不懂自己签的是什么。",
   "spoken": "第六种，签名人看不懂自己签的是什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 59.796,
   "dur": 3.744,
   "speechStart": 59.894,
   "speechEnd": 62.715
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "2024 年 7 月的 WazirX，签名人看到的，和签下的不一致，损失约 2.3 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 7 月的 WazirX，签名人看到的，和签下的不一致，损失约 2.3 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 63.76,
   "dur": 7.008,
   "speechStart": 63.858,
   "speechEnd": 69.941
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月的 Bybit，多签前端的脚本被精准篡改，只对目标地址生效。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月的 Bybit，多签前端的脚本被精准篡改，只对目标地址生效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 70.988,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 71.086,
   "speechEnd": 76.621
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "签名人盲签了一笔 delegatecall，按 FBI 口径，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "签名人盲签了一笔 delegatecall，按 FBI 口径，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 77.688,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 77.786,
   "speechEnd": 83.167
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "TRON 上的权限诈骗也是这一种，用户签下的，是交出自己账户的权限。",
   "spoken": "TRON 上的权限诈骗也是这一种，用户签下的，是交出自己账户的权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 84.22,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 84.318,
   "speechEnd": 89.484
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "识别信号是，签名界面只显示哈希或摘要。",
   "spoken": "识别信号是，签名界面只显示哈希或摘要。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 90.536,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 90.634,
   "speechEnd": 94.562
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "防御是独立解码，在硬件钱包上核对，delegatecall 只许指向白名单里的合约。",
   "spoken": "防御是独立解码，在硬件钱包上核对，delegatecall 只许指向白名单里的合约。",
